Surface: read a raw link without mouse capture or modifier policy

Adds ghostty_surface_read_link. Coordinates use the same surface points as
mouse_pos, and the returned URL is owned and freed with ghostty_string_free.
It reuses OSC 8 data and configured link patterns without resolving paths.
Existing link callbacks and mouse behavior are unchanged.

